    "['track [parameter1] interface [parameter2] line-protocol', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set chassis network-services enhanced-ip', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set chassis network-services enhanced-ip', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset chassis network-services enhanced-ip\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 gigether-options 802.3ad interface-track\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 gigether-options 802.3ad link-protection\\nset protocols track track-1 interface ge-1/0/2\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. Juniper requires enabling enhanced IP services first for full tracking capabilities\\n2. The interface must be configured with link protection and tracking options\\n3. The actual tracking is configured under protocols with a name (track-1) and interface reference\\n\\nNote: Juniper doesn't have an exact 1:1 equivalent for Cisco's line-protocol tracking, but this configuration provides similar functionality by tracking the interface's operational state.\", 'trans_template': 'set chassis network-services enhanced-ip'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 gigether-options 802.3ad interface-track', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/2 gigether-options 802.3ad interface-track', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset chassis network-services enhanced-ip\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 gigether-options 802.3ad interface-track\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/2 gigether-options 802.3ad link-protection\\nset protocols track track-1 interface ge-1/0/2\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. Juniper requires enabling enhanced IP services first for full tracking capabilities\\n2. The interface must be configured with link protection and tracking options\\n3. The actual tracking is configured under protocols with a name (track-1) and interface reference\\n\\nNote: Juniper doesn't have an exact 1:1 equivalent for Cisco's line-protocol tracking, but this configuration provides similar functionality by tracking the interface's operational state.\", 'trans_te